s\n• Shake Shack\n• Domino's\n• Wendy's\n• DutchBros \n\n17. Movie theaters - \"streaming killed movie theaters\"\n• Dolby Labs\n• AMC Entertainment\n• Cinemark\n\nYou watched Amazon go from $7 to $3,000. You watched Bitcoin go from $200 to $100,000.  You watched SanDisk go from $50 to $2,000.\n\nEvery single one of those was on a list exactly like this one. Beaten down. Hated. Laughed at. \"It will never work.\" \"It's too risky.\" \"The industry is dead.\"\n\nYou are looking at the next version of that list right now. Do NOT miss your chance.",
